# Dialyzer
/priv/plts/

# ExDoc
/docs/

# ExUnit
/.elixir_ls/

# Mix archives
/archives/

# Test artifacts
/test/fixtures/tmp/

### Elixir Release ###
/rel/artifacts/
/rel/builds/

